@startuml selma_authorization
' ============================================================
' Selma — Capability Authorization State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §3.2, §3.2.1, §9.6
'          User_Stories.md S-32, S-33, S-34
' C4:      Application Service (ingress gate)
'          + Lifecycle Finder / Conflict Resolver (domain gates)
'          denials → Findings & Audit Trail Adapter → event_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Cross-cutting behavioral security model. Applies to humans,
' service accounts, and AI agents (same matrix; actor = agent ID).
' Delegation is NOT supported in v8.2.x.
' Ownership / matrix summary: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Capability Authorization FSM\n<size:12><i>Request → matrix → SoD → stage gate → allow | deny + audit · hard-reject</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> RequestReceived : <b>ingress</b>\nactor: any authenticated or unauthenticated caller\ncommand: any mutating or gated read\nevent: AuthzRequestReceived

state "Request\nReceived" as RequestReceived #B9770E : **entry** raw request at interface\n**allowed** authenticate\n**forbidden** domain mutation
state "Identity\nVerified" as IdentityVerified #1B7A6E : **entry** authenticated actor\nrole bound (RO | CR | System | AI)\n**allowed** matrix lookup\n**forbidden** anonymous dispatch
state "Capability\nEvaluated" as CapabilityEvaluated #1B7A6E : **entry** matrix role × capability\n**allowed** PASS → SoD or stage\n**forbidden** implicit grant\nmatrix: Official directive.* · finding.dismiss/waive/\napprove/reject/supersede · conflict.resolve\nCompliance: inspection.* · acknowledge · evidence\nSystem: inspection.submit · finding.view · analytics.view
state "SoD\nEvaluated" as SoDEvaluated #B9770E : **entry** only finding.waive or\nfinding.approve_remediation\n**allowed** SoD-1 creator_provenance\nSoD-2 evidence_submitter\n**forbidden** skip SoD on those actions
state "Stage Gate\nChecked" as StageGateChecked #1B7A6E : **entry** enforcement point match\n1 ingress · 2 directive write lock\n3 inspection entry · 4 Finding FSM\n5 conflict resolution\n**forbidden** bypass stage
state "Allowed" as Allowed #2C6E49 : **entry** proceed to domain FSM/pipeline\n**allowed** dispatch command\n**forbidden** skip audit on later deny paths (N/A)
state "Denied" as Denied #A93226 : **entry** 403 CapabilityDenied\n**allowed** audit only\n**forbidden** partial write · compensating success event\n· degraded-mode · auto-escalation
state "Denial\nAudited" as DenialAudited #4A4A4A : **entry** append-only denial record\n{actor, capability, action,\noutcome:denied, timestamp, reason}\n**allowed** return error to caller\n**forbidden** mutate domain aggregate
state "Domain State\nUnchanged" as DomainUnchanged #A93226 : **entry** hard reject complete **terminal**\n**allowed** caller decides next action\n**forbidden** silent retry as success

RequestReceived --> IdentityVerified : <b>authenticate</b>\nactor: System (Application Service)\ncommand: bind identity + role\nevent: AuthzIdentityVerified
RequestReceived --> Denied : <b>unauthenticated</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDenied\naction: reason=unauthenticated

IdentityVerified --> CapabilityEvaluated : <b>role resolved</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: matrix lookup\nevent: AuthzCapabilityChecked

CapabilityEvaluated --> SoDEvaluated : <b>matrix PASS</b>\nactor: System\nguard: action ∈ {finding.waive, finding.approve_remediation}\nevent: AuthzSoDRequired
CapabilityEvaluated --> StageGateChecked : <b>matrix PASS</b>\nactor: System\nguard: action ∉ SoD set\nevent: AuthzSoDSkipped
CapabilityEvaluated --> Denied : <b>matrix FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDenied\naction: capability not granted to role

SoDEvaluated --> StageGateChecked : <b>SoD PASS</b>\nactor: System\nguard: waive ⇒ actor ∉ creator_provenance\nguard: approve ⇒ actor ≠ evidence_submitter\nevent: AuthzSoDPassed
SoDEvaluated --> Denied : <b>SoD FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDenied\naction: creator_provenance or evidence_submitter conflict

StageGateChecked --> Allowed : <b>stage OK</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzAllowed
StageGateChecked --> Denied : <b>stage FAIL</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDenied\naction: stage capability mismatch

Allowed --> [*] : <b>dispatch domain command</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDispatched
Denied --> DenialAudited : <b>record denial</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: append denial audit\nevent: AuthzDenialAudited
DenialAudited --> DomainUnchanged : <b>hard reject</b>\nactor: System\nevent: AuthzDomainUnchanged
DomainUnchanged --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
